 "title": "Contract Essential Elements",
 "status": "active",
 "text": "It is essential to the existence of a contract that there should be:\n1. Parties capable of contracting;\n2. Their consent;\n3. A lawful object; and,\n4. A sufficient cause or consideration.\n(Enacted 1872.)",
